WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.896 --> 00:00:06.702
Once upon a time, a king and queen longed for a child.

2
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:33.186
As the years passed, the king tried to be patient.

3
00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.269
But he was an impatient man.

4
00:00:37.289 --> 00:00:39.490
"My queen!"

5
00:00:39.891 --> 00:00:40.911
he moaned one day.

6
00:00:40.931 --> 00:00:43.133
"We need a child.

7
00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:45.635
Other kings have children—lots of children.

8
00:00:46.195 --> 00:00:48.296
Why, I know a king with 12 of them!"

9
00:00:49.417 --> 00:00:50.958
The queen lifted an eyebrow.

10
00:00:51.639 --> 00:00:53.840
"Twelve children?"

11
00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:58.944
She patted the king's arm.

12
00:00:59.612 --> 00:01:01.073
"Our turn will come.

13
00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:02.934
Just be patient."

14
00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:06.255
The king sighed and went outside.

15
00:01:08.076 --> 00:01:11.817
Walking along the palace's lovely lake always made him feel better.

16
00:01:13.798 --> 00:01:15.219
Soon their turn came.

17
00:01:16.399 --> 00:01:18.540
The queen gave birth to a child.

18
00:01:24.463 --> 00:01:25.843
beautiful daughter!"

19
00:01:26.163 --> 00:01:27.384
the king cried in delight.

20
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.082
"We'll name her Ellen!"

21
00:01:32.123 --> 00:01:34.886
The new parents began planning the baby's baptism.

22
00:01:35.726 --> 00:01:38.268
The king was in charge of sending out invitations.

23
00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.692
He was in such a hurry, he made a mistake.

24
00:01:43.093 --> 00:01:46.696
He forgot to invite his sister, Lady Agnes.

25
00:01:47.636 --> 00:01:49.458
This might surprise you, reader.

26
00:01:50.099 --> 00:01:53.041
How could the king forget to invite his own sister?

27
00:01:53.862 --> 00:01:56.224
Because he tried never to think of her!

28
00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.622
Agnes was a sour, spiteful woman.

29
00:02:01.883 --> 00:02:05.685
In fact, no one liked Agnes, not even her black cat.

30
00:02:08.687 --> 00:02:13.030
She had a huge forehead and a face filled with ugly wrinkles.

31
00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.272
When she was mad, her eyes flashed blue.

32
00:02:17.992 --> 00:02:21.915
When she was really mad, they flashed yellow and green.

33
00:02:23.536 --> 00:02:27.683
Oh, and Agnes had a dark secret, which few people knew.

34
00:02:29.444 --> 00:02:33.047
She was a witch—a very wicked witch!

35
00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:41.573
The news about Princess Ellen spread through the kingdom.

36
00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:50.000
will be a special baptism at the palace," Agnes said.

37
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.542
"And I will be invited!"

38
00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:57.184
Each day Agnes checked her mail.

39
00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:03.669
Each day she found the same thing—no invitation.

40
00:03:03.689 --> 00:03:07.892
"Grr." Agnes stomped her foot.

41
00:03:07.912 --> 00:03:11.594
"I hope my brother didn't forget about me!"

42
00:03:13.796 --> 00:03:16.077
The day of the baptism finally arrived.

43
00:03:17.138 --> 00:03:19.560
By now Agnes' mind was made up.

44
00:03:21.708 --> 00:03:24.910
"I'll go to the baptism without an invitation!"

45
00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:25.791
she said.

46
00:03:26.531 --> 00:03:30.374
She put on her best dress and climbed into a carriage.

47
00:03:32.495 --> 00:03:37.538
As she traveled toward the palace, Agnes' eyes flashed yellow and green.

48
00:03:37.558 --> 00:03:40.760
"Mark my words!

49
00:03:41.981 --> 00:03:45.763
My rude brother will never forget about me again!"
